involving a breach of the peace, or (f) habitually commits, or attempts to commit, or abets the commission of (i) any offence under one or more of the following Acts, namely:
(a) the Drugs and Cosmetics Act, 1940 (23 of 1940);
(b) the Foreign Exchange Regulation Act, 1973 (46 of 1973);
(c) the Employees' Provident Funds and Family Pension Fund Act, 1952 (19 of 1952);
